d␀/ota␀␀␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'>␀␀␀<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>␀<title>Firmware update</title><link rel='stylesheet' href='/ota.css'></head><body data-ota-checking='␀␀␀' data-ota-allowed='␀␀␀␀'><div id='ota-progress' class='ota-progress' role='alert' aria-live='assertive'><div class='ota-progress-box'><div class='spinner'></div><h2 id='ota-progress-title'>Installing firmwareâ€¦</h2><p id='ota-progress-text'>Do not disconnect power or close this page.</p><button type='button' id='ota-reconnect' hidden>Check connection again</button></div></div><div class='wrap'>␀<div class='card'><h1>Firmware update</h1><p class='muted'>Device: <code>␀␀␀</code><br>Current firmware: <strong>v␀␀</strong><br>Board: <strong>␀␀␀␀</strong> / ␀␀␀␀</p><p><a class='btn secondary' href='/'>Back to Web UI</a></p></div>␀␀␀<div class='msg ␀␀␀␀'>␀␀<p id='ota-preparation-required' class='msg' role='status'␀␀ hidden␀<div class='card'><h2>Automatic update</h2><p class='muted'>Use this when the device has internet access. It downloads the latest board-specific app build from the project web flasher and installs it automatically.</p>␀␀<div class='version-state current'>Checking for firmware updates in the backgroundâ€¦</div>␀<div class='version-state bad'>Update check failed: ␀␀␀␀<div class='version-state update'>New firmware available: v␀</div><form id='ota-install-form' method='post' action='/ota/install'><button type='submit'␀>Download and install v␀</button></form>␀␀␀␀<div class='version-state current'><strong>Firmware is up to date.</strong><br><span class='muted'>Latest available: v␀␀</span></div>␀␀␀<p><a class='btn secondary' href='/ota?refresh=1'>Check again</a></p><p class='muted'>Firmware file: <code>␀</code></p>␀<p class='bad'>Automatic update is unavailable for this board profile. Upload a matching app-only firmware file manually.</p>␀␀␀<div class='card'><h2>Upload compiled file</h2><p class='muted'>Use this when the device h